#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Upload the downloaded file to the server and run this command in SSH. sudo "
"is used only by the standalone helper to read host configuration that "
"WordPress itself cannot see."
msgstr ""
"Augšupielādējiet lejupielādēto failu serverī un palaidiet šo komandu SSH "
"vidē. sudo izmanto tikai atsevišķais palīgs, lai lasītu resursdatora "
"konfigurāciju, ko WordPress pats neredz."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Usage credits"
msgstr "Izmantošanas kredīti"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Usage reset"
msgstr "Izmantošanas perioda atiestatīšana"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Use Insights to review route medians and recent stability."
msgstr "Izmantojiet ieskatus, lai pārskatītu maršrutu mediānas un neseno stabilitāti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Use Tools for bounded purge and prewarm operations."
msgstr "Izmantojiet rīkus ierobežotām iztīrīšanas un uzsildīšanas darbībām."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Use a Custom Token for this zone only: Zone Read, Zone Settings Edit and "
"Cache Purge. Do not grant Bot Management, WAF, DNS or account-wide "
"administrator permissions."
msgstr ""
"Izmantojiet tikai šai zonai paredzētu pielāgotu marķieri: Zone Read, Zone "
"Settings Edit un Cache Purge. Nepiešķiriet botu pārvaldības, WAF, DNS vai "
"visa konta administratora atļaujas."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Use a Custom Token limited to this zone."
msgstr "Izmantojiet pielāgotu marķieri, kas ierobežots ar šo zonu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Use the explicit retirement buttons in Step 4. Each action is bounded, "
"verified in place and reversible until the protected handover succeeds. "
"advanced-cache.php remains automatic."
msgstr ""
"Izmantojiet nepārprotamas izslēgšanas pogas 4. solī. Katra darbība ir "
"ierobežota, pārbaudīta uz vietas un atgriezeniska līdz aizsargātās nodošanas"
" pabeigšanai. advanced-cache.php tiek apstrādāts automātiski."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"Use the heaviest measured route to decide whether query guard, application "
"tuning or host/database investigation should come next."
msgstr ""
"Izmantojiet visnoslogotāko izmērīto maršrutu, lai izlemtu, vai nākamais "
"solis ir vaicājumu aizsardzība, lietotnes regulēšana vai "
"resursdatora/datubāzes izpēte."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Use this model"
msgstr "Izmantot šo modeli"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"Useful only with explicit fragment boundaries and invalidation contracts. "
"YPerf will not guess dynamic WooCommerce fragments."
msgstr ""
"Noderīgi tikai ar nepārprotamām fragmentu robežām un anulēšanas līgumiem. "
"YPerf neminēs dinamiskos WooCommerce fragmentus."

msgid "User deactivation confirmed."
msgstr "Lietotāja veikta deaktivizēšana apstiprināta."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "User may choose it even when another engine benchmarks faster."
msgstr ""
"Lietotājs var to izvēlēties pat tad, ja cits dzinis veiktspējas testā ir "
"ātrāks."

msgid "User-confirmed protected handoff"
msgstr "Lietotāja apstiprināta aizsargātā nodošana"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Uses the native max_children that already exists. No pool file, service or "
"process is changed."
msgstr ""
"Izmanto jau esošo vietējo max_children. Neviens pūla fails, pakalpojums vai "
"process netiek mainīts."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "VARIABLE"
msgstr "MAINĪGS"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "VERIFY CONNECTION"
msgstr "PĀRBAUDĪT SAVIENOJUMU"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
